tion 251 of the NHS Act 2006, covering the following', 0.9917447858236053], [[[169.0, 1248.0], [286.0, 1248.0], [286.0, 1273.0], [169.0, 1273.0]], 'scenarios:', 0.9911179423332215], [[[168.0, 1304.0], [1252.0, 1305.0], [1252.0, 1335.0], [168.0, 1334.0]], 'Linkageofscreening log data using apseudo-identifier toCMPnational clinical audit database', 0.9637237207757102], [[[169.0, 1364.0], [1242.0, 1364.0], [1242.0, 1394.0], [169.0, 1394.0]], 'To ensure equality, diversity, and inclusiveness and assess the representativeness of the trial', 0.9883634924888611], [[[168.0, 1395.0], [1235.0, 1393.0], [1235.0, 1423.0], [168.0, 1425.0]], 'population, it is important to be able to obtain minimal anonymised information about patients', 0.9885814684502622], [[[166.0, 1454.0], [1258.0, 1453.0], [1258.0, 1483.0], [166.0, 1484.0]], 'criterion or because they were missed by the study team). We will seek approval from the CAG', 0.9942385016576104], [[[166.0, 1484.0], [1257.0, 1484.0], [1257.0, 1513.0], [166.0, 1513.0]], 'to collect a pseudo-identifier—Case MixProgramme admission number—for patients screened', 0.9706363534105236], [[[167.0, 1513.0], [1189.0, 1513.0], [1189.0, 1544.0], [167.0, 1544.0]], 'but not enrolled into the trial, to permit linkage to pseudonymised data from the Case Mix', 0.9898532549540202], [[[168.0, 1545.0], [1276.0, 1545.0], [1276.0, 1574.0], [168.0, 1574.0]], 'Programme national clinical audit to allow us to review whether certain subgroups of patients are', 0.9955751797587601], [[[165.0, 1572.0], [1277.0, 1573.0], [1277.0, 1606.0], [165.0, 1605.0]], 'being excluded to ensure appropriate equality, diversity, and inclusiveness of the trial population.', 0.9957727742195129], [[[168.0, 1632.0], [1220.0, 1633.0], [1220.0, 1662.0], [168.0, 1661.0]], 'Processingofidentifiabledataforparticipantsfromwhomconsentorconsulteeopinionwas', 0.9941570147683348], [[[170.0, 1665.0], [419.0, 1665.0], [419.0, 1692.0], [170.0, 1692.0]], 'unabletobeobtained', 0.9959894286261665]